WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 4]

01:40.500 --> 01:43.910
[Jiayuan City]

01:43.910 --> 01:45.140
Welcome to Jiayuan City, sir!

01:45.400 --> 01:45.980
Right this way.

01:46.000 --> 01:46.300
No need.

01:46.320 --> 01:46.990
Check out my shop.

01:48.170 --> 01:49.730
You dare steal business from Lone Manor?

01:49.910 --> 01:50.490
Tired of living?

01:50.560 --> 01:51.010
Get over here!

01:52.440 --> 01:53.740
You just hit someone from the Black Bear Gang?

01:54.070 --> 01:54.850
You're asking for trouble!

01:58.320 --> 01:59.100
Hey, sir!

01:59.440 --> 02:00.690
Welcome to Jiayuan City!

02:00.830 --> 02:01.690
Right over here.

02:01.870 --> 02:02.740
We've got a little shop.

02:02.760 --> 02:03.900
Our herbal tea

02:03.920 --> 02:05.980
is the perfect thing to cool off with.

02:06.230 --> 02:07.260
Take a sip on a hot day

02:07.280 --> 02:07.980
to feel refreshed!

02:08.000 --> 02:08.500
Come on!

02:08.670 --> 02:09.690
Right this way, sir.

02:09.750 --> 02:11.050
Please, have a seat.

02:11.430 --> 02:12.180
Take a look around!

02:13.320 --> 02:14.330
Great taste, sir!

02:15.080 --> 02:15.720
Waiter!

02:16.030 --> 02:16.690
Bring some tea!

02:17.390 --> 02:17.730
Here you go!

02:18.030 --> 02:18.500
This way.

02:18.560 --> 02:19.820
Come, have a seat.

02:22.200 --> 02:22.940
Right this way!

02:25.030 --> 02:25.540
Come on in!

02:25.670 --> 02:26.180
Sir.

02:26.470 --> 02:27.130
Give it a try!

02:27.920 --> 02:29.180
This tea...

02:29.270 --> 02:30.650
[Sun Ergou]
This tea of ours

02:31.280 --> 02:32.650
really hits the spot!

02:32.670 --> 02:33.450
It's the real deal.

02:36.880 --> 02:37.620
Uh, excuse me.

02:37.670 --> 02:38.260
I need

02:38.520 --> 02:39.330
some information.

02:40.510 --> 02:41.900
You've come to the right guy!

02:42.070 --> 02:42.900
Here in Jiayuan City,

02:43.040 --> 02:45.210
there's nothing I, Sun Ergou, don't know!

02:45.640 --> 02:46.290
What do you need?

02:47.590 --> 02:48.380
Mo Juren.

02:48.590 --> 02:49.180
The Mo Residence.

02:50.370 --> 02:51.480
Mo Juren...

02:51.480 --> 02:52.410
Physician Mo?

02:52.590 --> 02:53.330
Oh, his family?

02:53.430 --> 02:54.100
I know everything!

03:04.950 --> 03:05.930
Something big just happened

03:06.000 --> 03:07.100
at Physician Mo's place.

03:07.590 --> 03:08.410
What happened?

03:09.950 --> 03:10.850
Physician Mo

03:11.400 --> 03:12.180
is now dead.

03:14.430 --> 03:15.460
He died?

03:16.680 --> 03:17.740
No one else knows yet.

03:21.310 --> 03:22.180
How do you know?

03:23.560 --> 03:25.490
His final disciple told me himself.

03:27.350 --> 03:28.690
Final disciple?

03:29.640 --> 03:30.180
Who was it?

03:31.350 --> 03:31.930
Wu Jianming.

03:39.350 --> 03:39.930
Hey, beggar boy!

03:39.950 --> 03:40.450
Move it! Move!

03:40.450 --> 03:40.980
Out of the way!

03:41.000 --> 03:41.850
Move, you little brat!

03:42.510 --> 03:43.660
Open your eyes!

03:43.680 --> 03:44.220
My young master

03:44.240 --> 03:44.980
is coming through!

03:45.080 --> 03:45.730
Out of the way!

03:48.120 --> 03:49.060
That's him!

03:51.470 --> 03:52.540
- Make way! - Don't block the road!

03:52.630 --> 03:54.280
This kid's no ordinary punk.

03:54.280 --> 03:54.920
Who do you think you are?

03:54.920 --> 03:55.260
Get lost.

03:55.430 --> 03:56.500
He got into trouble a few years ago.

03:56.630 --> 03:57.890
The Five-Color Sect kicked him out.

03:57.910 --> 03:58.540
Move aside!

03:58.560 --> 04:00.660
Now he goes around saying he's Physician Mo's final disciple.

04:00.870 --> 04:01.730
Just last month,

04:02.000 --> 04:04.290
he got engaged to Miss Yuzhu, the first daughter of the Mo family.

04:04.520 --> 04:05.890
They are picking a date for the wedding.

04:06.750 --> 04:08.410
The entire Mo family business

04:08.960 --> 04:10.820
might fall right into his hands.

04:12.630 --> 04:13.380
That means

04:14.140 --> 04:15.570
the Sunwarm Jade that cures poison

04:16.470 --> 04:17.540
will be part

04:18.000 --> 04:18.980
of her dowry too.

04:27.630 --> 04:28.060
Sir?

04:28.630 --> 04:29.220
Are you alright?

04:29.240 --> 04:30.260
You're drenched in sweat.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.220
Did you get heatstroke?

04:31.400 --> 04:32.130
Waiter!

04:32.280 --> 04:32.980
A bowl of mung bean soup!

04:33.030 --> 04:33.540
Hurry!

04:33.960 --> 04:34.570
Do you have any rooms?

04:35.000 --> 04:35.850
Yes, we do.

04:36.000 --> 04:36.850
Get me an upper room.

04:37.190 --> 04:38.060
My friend needs to rest.

04:38.590 --> 04:39.010
Right away.

04:39.150 --> 04:39.540
Don't worry.

04:39.680 --> 04:40.260
- Alright. - Come on.

04:41.560 --> 04:42.290
Watch your step, sir.

04:48.150 --> 04:49.260
The poison from the Silver Demon Palm

04:50.030 --> 04:51.340
has been acting up more often.

04:52.190 --> 04:54.220
I have to get the jade before Miss Mo gets married.

04:55.000 --> 04:56.340
If I don't get the Sunwarm Jade,

04:56.870 --> 04:58.260
Wu will probably take it for himself.

05:03.080 --> 05:03.780
Get some rest.

05:04.400 --> 05:05.220
Until the bell rings,

05:05.710 --> 05:06.450
don't go anywhere.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.690
The secret branch in Changping Town

05:18.710 --> 05:21.010
sent in 7,300 taels of silver.

05:21.750 --> 05:23.060
The one in Luogu Town

05:23.190 --> 05:25.690
only sent 5,800 taels.

05:27.080 --> 05:28.850
These secret branches are getting worse every year.

05:29.150 --> 05:30.380
The silver they sent this year

05:30.520 --> 05:32.130
[Mo Caihuan]
is over a quarter less than usual.

05:32.740 --> 05:34.580
[Mo Fengwu and Mo Yuzhu]

05:38.120 --> 05:38.730
What is this?

05:39.560 --> 05:40.940
That's Father's Dragon Mark Ring.

05:43.400 --> 05:44.260
Thief!

05:46.470 --> 05:47.060
I'm not a thief.

06:02.680 --> 06:03.490
Ladies of the Mo family,

06:04.070 --> 06:06.370
I am Han Li, Physician Mo's final disciple.

06:06.950 --> 06:07.850
I came to pay my respects.

06:08.240 --> 06:09.410
Final disciple?

06:10.430 --> 06:12.050
Another one of those impostors.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.610
[To Madam]
This is Master's handwritten letter.

06:18.870 --> 06:19.540
Please have a look.

06:21.360 --> 06:22.250
Go fetch Mother.

06:28.830 --> 06:29.730
Come to the main hall.

06:30.510 --> 06:32.410
You should hand the letter to Mother yourself.

06:33.600 --> 06:33.930
Alright.

06:57.870 --> 06:59.340
It's dark. Watch your step.

07:00.630 --> 07:01.780
The Master has been gone so long.

07:01.800 --> 07:03.170
He finally remembered us.

07:03.510 --> 07:04.610
- One of them. - That's right.

07:04.720 --> 07:05.410
At least

07:05.430 --> 07:07.460
we finally heard something from him today.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.250
Two of them.

07:08.310 --> 07:10.460
What kind of final disciple did he take in?

07:11.070 --> 07:11.610
- Three of them. -Yeah,

07:11.630 --> 07:12.610
what does he even look like?

07:12.630 --> 07:13.700
- Four. - Final disciple, really?

07:14.480 --> 07:15.290
Unbelievable.

07:16.390 --> 07:16.980
Five, six.

07:18.390 --> 07:19.290
Why are there so many?

07:20.630 --> 07:21.220
Watch out.

07:26.390 --> 07:28.660
So, you're the real final disciple.

07:29.070 --> 07:31.700
You're a lot better than that impostor Wu Jianming.

07:32.680 --> 07:34.250
Why haven't we heard of you before?

07:34.600 --> 07:36.020
This final disciple

07:36.120 --> 07:37.140
seems alright.

07:39.000 --> 07:39.980
Pretty handsome too.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.220
Not bad.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.780
Looks like the Master made the right choice.

07:43.950 --> 07:44.980
He's impressive.

07:45.390 --> 07:46.340
Very impressive.

07:47.870 --> 07:48.930
Newcomer,

07:49.480 --> 07:49.930
this is

07:50.070 --> 07:51.340
my mother, Madam Li of the Mo family.

07:51.860 --> 07:53.160
[Madam Li]

07:53.160 --> 07:54.610
This is Third Madam, Madam Liu.

07:54.610 --> 07:55.560
[Madam Liu]

07:55.560 --> 07:57.050
Fourth Madam, Madam Yan.

07:57.050 --> 07:58.310
[Madam Yan]

07:58.310 --> 07:59.100
And Fifth Madam,

07:59.270 --> 07:59.930
Madam Wang.

08:00.220 --> 08:01.660
[Madam Wang]

08:02.600 --> 08:03.340
I am Han Li.

08:03.870 --> 08:04.780
Greetings, Madams.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.490
Han Li?

08:08.430 --> 08:09.610
My eldest sister, Yuzhu.

08:09.800 --> 08:10.780
I am Fengwu.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.250
My younger sister, Caihuan.

08:15.560 --> 08:16.370
Greetings, ladies.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.930
So, she isn't a servant.

08:23.720 --> 08:24.460
Young man.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.850
Did that old fool say when he'll be back?

08:28.070 --> 08:28.780
Madam Liu,

08:29.390 --> 08:30.410
whatever Master wanted to say

08:30.800 --> 08:31.730
was written in the letter.

08:32.510 --> 08:33.250
Letter?

08:35.120 --> 08:35.810
Where's the letter?

08:49.430 --> 08:51.900
My wife and daughter, may this letter stand in for my presence

08:52.070 --> 08:53.980
I'm entangled in pressing matters

08:54.000 --> 08:56.660
and still can't return home anytime soon.

08:57.310 --> 08:58.460
The one delivering this letter

08:58.600 --> 09:00.140
is my final disciple,

09:00.270 --> 09:01.220
Han Li.

09:01.920 --> 09:03.370
He possesses unique skills

09:03.390 --> 09:05.660
and can be trusted.

09:06.360 --> 09:08.410
If anything happens at the Mo Residence,

09:08.750 --> 09:10.730
feel free to let him handle it.

09:11.310 --> 09:14.410
If he can keep the Mo family safe,

09:14.600 --> 09:15.900
then he may choose

09:15.920 --> 09:17.980
to marry one from Yuzhu, Fengwu,

09:18.240 --> 09:19.490
or Caihuan.

09:19.750 --> 09:21.100
As for her dowry,

09:21.600 --> 09:24.340
use the Sunwarm Jade.

09:30.630 --> 09:31.610
Why are they looking

09:32.430 --> 09:33.460
so guarded?

09:34.510 --> 09:35.250
It doesn't make sense.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.810
I've read this letter hundreds of times.

09:38.120 --> 09:39.340
There's nothing suspicious in it.

09:52.190 --> 09:53.100
Master cares deeply

09:53.270 --> 09:54.140
for the family.

09:54.920 --> 09:56.020
He wants me

09:56.190 --> 09:57.100
to ease the burdens

09:57.360 --> 09:58.410
on the Mo family.

09:59.600 --> 10:01.410
If you ladies have anything urgent

10:01.430 --> 10:02.580
that needs dealing with,

10:03.000 --> 10:04.020
just let me know.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.050
I shall

10:05.160 --> 10:06.290
give it my all.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.530
It's getting late today.

10:12.240 --> 10:13.340
Young Master Han, why don't you

10:13.510 --> 10:14.890
stay here at the residence tonight?

10:15.480 --> 10:17.180
As for everything else,

10:18.630 --> 10:19.220
we can

10:19.510 --> 10:20.610
talk about it tomorrow.

10:21.390 --> 10:22.300
We'll discuss it tomorrow.

10:23.720 --> 10:24.490
- But... - Yuzhu,

10:24.960 --> 10:26.370
Fengwu, Caihuan,

10:26.600 --> 10:27.010
quickly.

10:27.120 --> 10:29.700
Show Young Master Han to the west wing to rest.

10:29.960 --> 10:30.890
Please.

10:49.080 --> 10:50.490
They're in such a rush to send me off.

10:51.270 --> 10:52.180
Something is up.

10:54.750 --> 10:56.420
You all remember

10:56.840 --> 10:58.530
what the Master told us before leaving.

10:59.390 --> 11:01.370
If valuables are sent here,

11:01.670 --> 11:02.940
all is well.

11:04.080 --> 11:05.340
But if it's a letter,

11:05.870 --> 11:06.890
it's most likely

11:07.360 --> 11:08.610
bad news.

11:08.910 --> 11:09.650
Madam Yan,

11:09.810 --> 11:10.890
let's read the letter.

11:11.600 --> 11:12.060
Very well.

11:12.510 --> 11:13.130
The secret letter

11:13.360 --> 11:14.420
will show its content.

11:14.960 --> 11:15.460
Secret letter?

11:16.150 --> 11:16.890
That old fool

11:17.240 --> 11:18.490
had a backup plan in place.

11:19.030 --> 11:20.820
I told you to stop fooling around.

11:22.360 --> 11:24.010
Our mothers seem to like him.

11:25.200 --> 11:25.770
Nanny Wu,

11:26.180 --> 11:27.220
bring some water.

11:30.270 --> 11:30.980
Why water?

11:39.870 --> 11:40.770
It's all silent now.

11:41.630 --> 11:42.300
Li,

11:42.480 --> 11:43.060
be honest.

11:43.150 --> 11:44.130
First impression of Yuzhu?

11:44.870 --> 11:45.820
What do you mean?

11:45.960 --> 11:47.100
My father told us

11:47.240 --> 11:48.300
he'd betroth one of us

11:48.320 --> 11:50.060
to his final disciple.

11:51.720 --> 11:53.060
You three are prestigious ladies.

11:53.550 --> 11:54.250
Master must have

11:54.270 --> 11:55.300
been kidding.

11:55.510 --> 11:56.420
I can't take it seriously.

11:57.120 --> 11:57.610
Ladies,

11:57.750 --> 11:58.650
you need not worry.

11:59.960 --> 12:01.420
Madam Wang, activate your inner strength.

12:02.150 --> 12:02.940
Inner strength?

12:11.360 --> 12:13.820
If you're reading this, it means I'm no longer

12:14.150 --> 12:15.100
of this world.

12:16.440 --> 12:17.770
The one who took my life was...

12:18.630 --> 12:19.340
Father would never

12:19.360 --> 12:20.060
- make a joke... - Did they finish reading?

12:20.080 --> 12:20.770
with our marriage.

12:22.150 --> 12:23.300
- Darn it. - My sister would like to speak with you.

12:23.360 --> 12:24.370
- What's on the letter? - Young Master Han?

12:24.600 --> 12:25.820
You came at the perfect time.

12:25.980 --> 12:27.000
- She talks a lot. - If you can get rid

12:27.000 --> 12:27.770
of that impostor Wu Jianming,

12:27.790 --> 12:28.640
I can't hear a thing.

12:28.640 --> 12:29.650
I don't mind marrying you.

12:29.840 --> 12:30.820
It's him!

12:31.670 --> 12:33.770
He looked like an honest fellow.

12:34.030 --> 12:35.370
Can't judge a book by its cover.

12:35.750 --> 12:36.850
If he could fool the Master,

12:37.080 --> 12:38.060
we must be cautious.

12:38.600 --> 12:39.700
What are they whispering?

12:40.840 --> 12:41.820
This grudge

12:42.390 --> 12:43.460
must be avenged.

12:43.750 --> 12:44.580
Vengeance is needed.

12:44.720 --> 12:45.730
He must pay for this.

12:45.750 --> 12:46.490
What now?

12:46.600 --> 12:47.340
We kill him.

12:47.360 --> 12:48.610
It's always the same methods.

12:48.750 --> 12:49.890
My venomous spider

12:50.270 --> 12:51.980
was a gift from the Master before he left.

12:52.200 --> 12:53.340
After all these years,

12:54.030 --> 12:55.530
it's time for it to get some fresh air.

12:55.720 --> 12:56.940
I have a recipe.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.340
The Master says

12:58.790 --> 13:00.220
to use it when necessary.

13:00.600 --> 13:01.530
Tonight,

13:01.760 --> 13:03.370
I'll brew the drug.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.300
Madam Yan, brew the drug

13:05.600 --> 13:06.820
for my Jade Hornet Sting.

13:06.960 --> 13:07.980
Before we act,

13:08.320 --> 13:09.820
we can knock him out with incense.

13:09.960 --> 13:10.370
One more thing.

13:10.550 --> 13:11.940
Father said you could choose,

13:12.120 --> 13:13.580
but you must marry me first.

13:13.670 --> 13:14.650
I am the oldest sister.

13:14.670 --> 13:15.530
I can't hear a thing.

13:15.550 --> 13:16.300
In this family,

13:16.510 --> 13:17.490
- the old ones can't get married. - They talk too much.

13:17.490 --> 13:18.610
The young can't get married yet.

13:22.030 --> 13:22.850
Miss Yuzhu, do you have

13:23.000 --> 13:23.940
the Sunwarm Jade?

13:24.840 --> 13:25.650
You need not worry.

13:25.910 --> 13:26.980
Since Mother said so,

13:27.150 --> 13:28.700
the Madams will take care of it.

13:28.840 --> 13:29.490
No,

13:29.630 --> 13:30.300
I mean,

13:30.360 --> 13:31.650
you'd better not be a greedy one.

13:31.670 --> 13:33.300
You'd ignore a beauty like Yuzhu?

13:33.320 --> 13:34.650
All you care about is the Sunwarm Jade.

13:35.000 --> 13:35.730
Forget it, Fengwu.

13:35.870 --> 13:36.730
Don't make things hard for him.

13:36.750 --> 13:37.340
Yuzhu!

13:37.360 --> 13:38.420
Don't speak like you've married him.

13:38.630 --> 13:39.580
I wasn't!

13:43.720 --> 13:44.610
The path ends here.

13:45.080 --> 13:45.890
Where am I staying?

13:46.790 --> 13:48.340
We got carried away chatting.

13:49.240 --> 13:50.130
West wing.

13:50.240 --> 13:50.980
This way.

13:53.720 --> 13:54.730
When do we make our move?

13:55.360 --> 13:56.100
Tonight.

13:56.270 --> 13:57.370
No time like the present.

13:57.720 --> 13:58.180
Alright.

14:00.120 --> 14:00.530
Wait.

14:03.720 --> 14:04.300
Young Master Han.

14:04.630 --> 14:05.530
Please.

14:06.550 --> 14:07.530
Thanks for walking me here.

14:08.150 --> 14:08.980
Rest well.

14:15.150 --> 14:17.100
I didn't say anything wrong just now, did I?

14:17.120 --> 14:18.490
He won't be upset, right?

14:18.630 --> 14:19.750
- Why are you still here? - I told you...

14:19.750 --> 14:20.640
to talk less.

14:20.920 --> 14:21.860
Alright. I'm going.

14:23.350 --> 14:24.160
- Go. - Go on.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.700
Did I say anything wrong just now?

14:25.880 --> 14:26.410
Right?

14:27.110 --> 14:28.290
What do you think about me and him?

14:28.520 --> 14:29.540
They are finally gone.

14:34.200 --> 14:35.980
Madam Yan always thinks things through.

14:39.670 --> 14:40.340
Strange.

14:40.870 --> 14:41.700
Why is it quiet again?

14:47.630 --> 14:49.370
- We'll go with your plan. - Whatever you say.

14:49.550 --> 14:50.130
Alright.

14:50.510 --> 14:52.180
Since everyone agrees,

14:52.600 --> 14:54.700
we still have to treat him well.

14:55.320 --> 14:56.890
Let him stay at the residence.

14:57.240 --> 14:58.460
Give him good food and drink.

14:58.790 --> 15:00.220
Let him build up his strength.

15:00.840 --> 15:01.820
That way,

15:02.240 --> 15:03.730
he'll be

15:04.030 --> 15:05.650
more useful to us later.

15:07.790 --> 15:08.490
Nanny Wu.

15:08.960 --> 15:11.010
Make sure Young Master Han gets a hearty breakfast.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.060
Use the same standard

15:12.270 --> 15:13.340
that we had for the Master.

15:18.670 --> 15:20.180
Whatever they're planning,

15:21.030 --> 15:22.460
I have to get the Sunwarm Jade

15:22.840 --> 15:23.490
they promised me.

15:44.960 --> 15:45.850
I'm running out of pills.

15:46.790 --> 15:48.490
Better save them for a critical moment.

16:24.120 --> 16:25.370
Good morning, Young Master Han.

16:26.030 --> 16:26.980
Mother asked Nanny Wu

16:27.000 --> 16:28.340
to prepare a hearty breakfast.

16:28.440 --> 16:29.490
Come eat with us.

16:35.630 --> 16:37.250
Young Master Han, have some.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.700
Everything was specially made

16:38.720 --> 16:40.530
by Nanny Wu at our mothers' request.

16:51.600 --> 16:53.460
I called someone greedy last night,

16:53.480 --> 16:55.180
but that was totally wrong.

16:55.480 --> 16:57.130
He's just stingy, that's what.

16:57.910 --> 16:59.340
Who comes as a guest,

16:59.440 --> 17:00.940
eats and drinks for free,

17:01.000 --> 17:02.250
and shows up empty-handed?

17:02.840 --> 17:03.850
That's enough.

17:04.150 --> 17:05.460
Can you stop going on and on?

17:05.600 --> 17:07.770
Asking him for gifts the moment you open your mouth?

17:07.960 --> 17:09.250
That's just as bad.

17:09.480 --> 17:10.250
Didn't he ask us

17:10.270 --> 17:11.370
for the Sunwarm Jade?

17:16.270 --> 17:16.850
Ladies,

17:17.910 --> 17:18.580
this meal,

17:19.200 --> 17:20.100
is too much for me.

17:20.600 --> 17:21.340
But,

17:21.620 --> 17:22.760
I do have something

17:23.320 --> 17:24.340
that can serve as a gift.

17:30.630 --> 17:31.340
What's this?

17:32.600 --> 17:33.300
This?

17:33.440 --> 17:34.460
It's called Fragrance Pellet.

17:34.870 --> 17:35.650
Carry it with you.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.650
It helps keep mosquitoes and bugs away

17:38.080 --> 17:38.980
with a light floral scent.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.250
It smells so good.

17:41.510 --> 17:43.060
What if men start lining up to propose?

17:45.240 --> 17:47.010
This is official imperial medicine.

17:47.440 --> 17:49.490
Such a rare and precious court medicine,

17:49.600 --> 17:50.610
and you're giving it away?

17:52.080 --> 17:54.060
Don't tell me you've fallen for the two of us.

17:54.670 --> 17:55.370
Fengwu,

17:55.870 --> 17:56.770
don't talk nonsense.

18:08.840 --> 18:09.770
All of this

18:10.120 --> 18:11.580
was made by Nanny Wu based on guesses.

18:11.840 --> 18:14.100
We're not sure if it suits your taste, Young Master Han.

18:14.510 --> 18:15.580
Whichever one you like,

18:15.790 --> 18:17.220
we'll have her make it again tomorrow.

18:21.720 --> 18:23.300
These two girls are noisy,

18:23.790 --> 18:25.610
but they're easier to deal with than the mothers.

18:26.870 --> 18:28.250
Until I find the jade,

18:28.870 --> 18:30.060
I'd better play along with them.

18:35.080 --> 18:35.850
Delicious.

18:36.120 --> 18:36.890
Do you like it?

18:39.510 --> 18:41.250
If you like it,

18:41.480 --> 18:43.050
then I like it too.

18:48.030 --> 18:48.700
My belly hurts.

18:49.680 --> 18:50.380
Mothers?

18:58.480 --> 18:59.220
You,

18:59.880 --> 19:00.940
come with us.

19:27.240 --> 19:28.490
We brought you here

19:29.070 --> 19:31.330
because there's something we want to ask you in person.

19:40.070 --> 19:40.730
No need to ask.

19:41.480 --> 19:42.620
I killed Physician Mo.

19:58.750 --> 20:00.050
At least you're honest.

20:00.590 --> 20:01.770
He tried to kill me first.

20:02.160 --> 20:02.860
All I did

20:03.160 --> 20:03.940
was defend myself.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.250
We can look past

20:14.830 --> 20:16.220
what you did to the Master.

20:17.070 --> 20:19.220
But you must agree to do something for us.

20:22.240 --> 20:22.980
Alright.

20:24.830 --> 20:25.900
But I want you

20:26.400 --> 20:28.420
to swear on Physician Mo's spirit.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.140
Once it's done,

20:30.590 --> 20:31.810
give me the Sunwarm Jade.

20:33.590 --> 20:35.090
Do you know who you're going after?

20:36.750 --> 20:37.660
I must have

20:38.160 --> 20:39.180
the Sunwarm Jade.

20:50.350 --> 20:52.050
His name is Ouyang Feitian.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.810
He has always committed evil acts.

20:54.000 --> 20:55.090
He slaughters the innocent.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.570
He has even spread the word

20:57.160 --> 20:58.290
that he'd wipe out our family.

20:58.720 --> 20:59.570
Eliminating him

20:59.720 --> 21:00.980
not only protects us,

21:01.200 --> 21:02.420
but also benefits the people.

21:04.160 --> 21:04.900
Fine.

21:09.110 --> 21:10.700
Don't say we didn't warn you.

21:10.920 --> 21:11.900
His martial skills

21:12.350 --> 21:13.460
surpass the Master's.

21:13.680 --> 21:15.010
He treasures his life dearly.

21:15.270 --> 21:17.220
He's probably surrounded by layers of traps.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.220
Underestimating him

21:18.350 --> 21:19.460
will only get you killed.

21:19.640 --> 21:21.180
Did you get all that?

21:22.030 --> 21:23.770
No need for you ladies to worry about that.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.420
And your sincerity?

21:28.830 --> 21:29.490
Alright.

21:29.960 --> 21:31.050
We can do that.

21:31.110 --> 21:32.010
We swear

21:32.110 --> 21:34.220
on the spirit of our late husband, Mo Juren.

21:35.590 --> 21:37.330
If you can get rid of

21:37.480 --> 21:39.420
Ouyang Feitian for us,

21:39.920 --> 21:42.140
we'll give you the Sunwarm Jade.

21:44.640 --> 21:45.420
Deal.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.290
Deal.

21:55.590 --> 21:57.460
It's like he didn't hesitate at all.

22:29.060 --> 22:31.310
[Ouyang Feitian]

22:31.310 --> 22:33.330
Who might this mighty warrior be?

22:41.240 --> 22:42.620
You're Ouyang Feitian?

22:44.880 --> 22:47.250
This is a sacred place of serenity.

22:48.510 --> 22:49.700
Don't be reckless.

22:50.200 --> 22:52.010
You're reeking of murderous intent,

22:52.550 --> 22:53.620
and you talk about serenity?

23:01.920 --> 23:03.860
You're a cultivator?

23:07.070 --> 23:08.700
A proper cultivator,

23:08.960 --> 23:09.900
getting involved

23:10.160 --> 23:11.330
in mortal disputes?

23:13.240 --> 23:14.380
Who sent you?

23:15.000 --> 23:16.570
Which family hired you?

23:16.920 --> 23:17.700
I am

23:18.350 --> 23:19.940
willing to pay double

23:20.400 --> 23:21.290
if you

23:22.160 --> 23:23.460
could spare me.

23:25.920 --> 23:26.700
Bargaining?

23:28.160 --> 23:29.180
I've looked into you.

23:29.880 --> 23:30.900
You've committed

23:31.440 --> 23:32.220
countless crimes.

23:33.750 --> 23:35.700
Now you think you can buy your life back?

23:36.920 --> 23:37.810
Master,

23:38.550 --> 23:40.860
why must you trouble a mere mortal like me?

23:41.310 --> 23:43.010
I've even sent men many times

23:43.200 --> 23:45.140
to Tainan Valley to seek cultivators,

23:45.960 --> 23:46.600
but

23:47.160 --> 23:48.900
I never managed to find any trace.

23:49.920 --> 23:51.530
Now that I finally met one,

23:52.590 --> 23:53.570
naturally,

23:54.070 --> 23:55.220
I'd like to build

23:55.480 --> 23:57.010
a good relationship with you.

24:00.960 --> 24:01.900
Tainan Valley?

24:02.960 --> 24:04.140
Yes.

24:05.550 --> 24:06.570
Since ancient times,

24:07.550 --> 24:08.770
Tainan Valley

24:09.070 --> 24:10.090
has been a gathering place

24:10.310 --> 24:11.420
for immortals.

24:13.030 --> 24:14.900
Legend has it that a hundred years ago,

24:15.510 --> 24:16.980
someone there

24:17.270 --> 24:18.220
was chosen

24:18.640 --> 24:19.980
to become a disciple of an immortal.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.420
Please look, Master.

24:28.590 --> 24:29.250
This is

24:30.160 --> 24:32.330
a map of Tainan Valley.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.900
If you wish to have it,

24:35.590 --> 24:36.330
I will

24:36.790 --> 24:38.530
gladly hand it over.

24:39.270 --> 24:40.050
Tainan Valley…

24:41.270 --> 24:42.490
That sounds familiar.

24:43.960 --> 24:45.460
Could there be other cultivators?

24:46.790 --> 24:49.250
Seems like you're not interested in that, Master.

24:49.920 --> 24:50.620
Well then,

24:50.750 --> 24:51.730
forget it.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.420
Once this is all done,

25:24.000 --> 25:25.290
I'll go check out Tainan Valley.

25:45.550 --> 25:46.250
Mother.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.180
Ouyang Feitian...

25:50.350 --> 25:51.180
We have news.

25:51.350 --> 25:52.330
What happened?

25:52.480 --> 25:53.620
He's dead.

25:54.030 --> 25:55.380
That fast?

25:55.720 --> 25:56.460
Mother!

25:56.480 --> 25:57.460
How is that possible?

25:59.030 --> 25:59.980
He is back.

26:01.200 --> 26:02.290
So soon?

26:07.590 --> 26:09.290
She is the only one who tends to the herbs.

26:10.110 --> 26:11.420
Looks like Physician Mo passed

26:11.790 --> 26:13.090
all his knowledge to this mute girl.

26:26.310 --> 26:27.090
It's done.

26:28.480 --> 26:29.180
Now hand over

26:29.680 --> 26:30.220
the Sunwarm Jade.

26:33.070 --> 26:33.860
This is indeed

26:34.000 --> 26:35.180
the Ouyang family heirloom

26:35.310 --> 26:37.090
from Lone Manor.

27:03.750 --> 27:04.700
What's the meaning of this?

27:05.270 --> 27:06.420
Trying to go back on your word?

27:06.790 --> 27:07.770
No.

27:08.310 --> 27:08.860
It's just

27:09.160 --> 27:10.220
that it happened so suddenly,

27:10.480 --> 27:10.940
we...

27:11.110 --> 27:12.660
we weren't prepared at all.

27:13.310 --> 27:14.090
Prepared for what?

27:14.830 --> 27:15.730
We had an agreement.

27:16.110 --> 27:16.810
I help you,

27:16.960 --> 27:17.810
you give me the jade.

27:18.240 --> 27:19.140
How long do you need?

27:21.200 --> 27:22.180
Ten days.

27:23.110 --> 27:24.050
Ten days?

27:24.830 --> 27:26.050
We originally estimated

27:26.240 --> 27:28.490
you and Ouyang Feitian would fight for ten days.

27:28.680 --> 27:31.250
Those ten days were critical for us to seize control

27:31.550 --> 27:33.420
of the Lone Manor forces.

27:33.480 --> 27:35.250
Who knew you'd kill him in just two hours?

27:35.350 --> 27:36.980
You completely disrupted our plan.

27:37.110 --> 27:38.460
That was way too fast.

27:40.350 --> 27:41.770
You told me to kill Ouyang Feitian,

27:42.000 --> 27:43.250
but you never said how long.

27:44.160 --> 27:44.730
Besides,

27:44.830 --> 27:45.700
you swore to me.

27:46.160 --> 27:46.530
Right.

27:47.030 --> 27:48.220
We did make a vow.

27:48.400 --> 27:49.980
We promised if you took care

27:50.000 --> 27:50.980
of Ouyang Feitian,

27:51.200 --> 27:53.050
we'd give you the Sunwarm Jade.

27:53.110 --> 27:54.010
But now what?

27:54.270 --> 27:55.700
You call that taking care of it?

27:55.830 --> 27:56.420
Exactly.

27:56.640 --> 27:57.770
One old problem is gone,

27:58.000 --> 27:59.250
and now a new one shows up.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.770
Now that Ouyang Feitian is dead,

28:01.070 --> 28:02.250
not just the Jingjiao Sect,

28:02.550 --> 28:04.700
but all of Jiayuan City will be in chaos.

28:04.920 --> 28:06.090
I even heard whispers

28:06.400 --> 28:08.180
that the Five-Color Sect will make a move tonight.

28:08.200 --> 28:09.330
- The Five-Color Sect? - Yes.

28:09.350 --> 28:09.830
Tonight?

28:09.830 --> 28:10.320
Yes.

28:10.720 --> 28:12.810
If they take over Lone Manor,

28:12.920 --> 28:13.770
what about us?

28:14.070 --> 28:15.390
Will we even survive?

28:15.830 --> 28:16.990
- What now? - What should we do?

28:17.110 --> 28:17.860
Seems like

28:18.030 --> 28:19.490
you didn't just kill the Master,

28:19.680 --> 28:21.860
you're also about to bring ruin to the Mo family!

28:23.110 --> 28:24.570
We're widows and orphans here.

28:24.590 --> 28:25.620
What are we supposed to do?

28:25.880 --> 28:26.480
- Yeah! - What now?

28:26.480 --> 28:27.900
Tell us what we should do!

28:27.960 --> 28:28.660
What should we do?

28:28.680 --> 28:29.810
Sounds to me like you're backing out!

28:30.070 --> 28:31.660
We're not backing out!

28:31.790 --> 28:33.220
Then, how do I get the jade?

28:36.240 --> 28:36.860
You...

28:37.750 --> 28:38.810
stay.

28:42.000 --> 28:42.730
That's impossible.

28:44.440 --> 28:45.730
Why not?

28:45.750 --> 28:46.250
Yeah!

28:46.270 --> 28:47.250
The Sunwarm Jade

28:47.270 --> 28:48.940
is the Mo family's heirloom treasure.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.570
And we've made a deal.

28:50.880 --> 28:51.530
Our family

28:51.720 --> 28:52.620
has three daughters,

28:52.750 --> 28:54.660
and they'll all marry you.

28:55.400 --> 28:57.700
The Sunwarm Jade would be their dowry.

28:57.830 --> 28:58.770
- All yours. - No way!

28:58.960 --> 29:00.220
- Everything yours. - I'm going to become an immortal!

29:00.240 --> 29:01.250
Our daughters

29:01.310 --> 29:02.770
are the pride of Jiayuan City.

29:02.920 --> 29:04.770
The Three Beauties of the Mo family!

29:04.790 --> 29:05.310
Trust me,

29:05.310 --> 29:07.330
people are lining up just to marry into this family.

29:07.350 --> 29:07.810
Exactly.

29:07.830 --> 29:09.050
You're scoring big here, you know?

29:09.070 --> 29:10.490
You even get the Sunwarm Jade!

29:10.510 --> 29:12.010
- Don't be ungrateful. - It's all yours!

29:12.030 --> 29:13.120
- So lucky. - Seriously.

29:13.880 --> 29:15.050
- Don't run! - You hit the jackpot!

29:15.070 --> 29:15.770
- Right? - Stop!

29:17.000 --> 29:17.660
Are you all done?

29:17.830 --> 29:18.490
Now hear me out.

29:19.480 --> 29:20.490
There's no way I'm staying.

29:21.200 --> 29:22.140
Come up with something else.

29:25.550 --> 29:26.900
There are still villains in the City.

29:39.880 --> 29:40.570
I wonder

29:40.590 --> 29:41.980
where they hide the Sunwarm Jade.

29:42.000 --> 29:43.570
If the three of us will marry Li...

29:43.590 --> 29:44.770
If I snatch it by force,

29:45.110 --> 29:46.330
- they might destroy it. - Yeah.

29:46.550 --> 29:47.330
That'd be trouble.

29:47.590 --> 29:48.570
You little rascal.

29:48.920 --> 29:49.620
Just say it.

29:49.790 --> 29:50.770
Do you agree or not?

29:51.790 --> 29:53.090
If they're all bad guys,

29:53.720 --> 29:54.940
then I'm just saving the people.

29:56.000 --> 29:58.010
But I can't let them keep dragging this out.

30:09.380 --> 30:13.420
[Mo Residence]

30:31.820 --> 30:34.180
[May I borrow the recipe for Fragrance Pellets?]

30:40.240 --> 30:40.980
It's you.

30:57.750 --> 30:58.770
Can you hear me?

31:03.720 --> 31:04.730
This book contains essentials

31:05.000 --> 31:06.290
of medicines written by your father.

31:07.440 --> 31:08.010
Aside from

31:08.160 --> 31:09.250
the Fragrance Pellet formula,

31:09.790 --> 31:11.010
I've also added my own notes.

31:11.590 --> 31:12.420
I hope it'll help you.

31:24.780 --> 31:27.460
[I'll return it after copying.]

31:29.030 --> 31:29.420
No need.

31:30.400 --> 31:31.660
This belongs to the Mo family.

31:32.400 --> 31:33.140
I'm returning it

31:33.400 --> 31:34.490
to its rightful owner.

31:47.720 --> 31:48.700
Of all in the Mo family,

31:49.440 --> 31:50.730
only she seems decent.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.530
Quiet and well-behaved.

31:54.000 --> 31:54.730
Looks like she has

31:55.000 --> 31:56.810
inherited Physician Mo's medical skills.

31:58.680 --> 31:59.860
Too bad she can't speak.

32:16.160 --> 32:16.980
Young Master Han.

32:19.590 --> 32:20.460
Young Master Han.

32:20.790 --> 32:21.900
Have some tea before you go.

32:26.310 --> 32:26.900
Never mind.

32:48.750 --> 32:49.980
That's a good idea.

32:52.880 --> 32:54.050
This man is nicknamed Black Bear.

32:54.240 --> 32:54.980
The Five-Color Sect's

32:55.000 --> 32:56.860
[Black Bear]
top contender for the next Sect Leader.

32:57.510 --> 32:59.090
He rose through the ranks by pillaging and killing.

32:59.310 --> 33:01.250
He even kills the elderly and children.

33:01.790 --> 33:02.530
Taking him out

33:02.550 --> 33:04.220
means removing a threat to the Mo Family.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.660
It rids the people of a menace.

33:06.240 --> 33:07.050
Once it's done,

33:07.240 --> 33:08.530
I'll hand over the Sunwarm Jade

33:08.590 --> 33:09.730
with both hands.

33:10.750 --> 33:12.140
We give you our word.

33:14.590 --> 33:15.570
So, you're Black Bear.

33:16.400 --> 33:18.860
Sounds like you really are rotten to the core.

33:20.270 --> 33:22.180
Who are you calling Black Bear?

33:33.310 --> 33:34.460
He did it again.

33:35.750 --> 33:37.290
He really killed Black Bear.

33:38.480 --> 33:39.330
So what do we do now?

33:39.830 --> 33:40.490
Are we seriously

33:40.590 --> 33:41.940
going to let him marry all three

33:42.070 --> 33:43.090
of our daughters?

33:44.110 --> 33:45.700
And give him the Sunwarm Jade too?

33:46.030 --> 33:46.570
No way.

33:46.720 --> 33:47.620
If he leaves,

33:47.790 --> 33:49.490
we'll be four helpless widows.

33:50.000 --> 33:50.570
Besides,

33:50.750 --> 33:52.050
we still have so many enemies.

33:52.960 --> 33:53.810
That's

33:54.070 --> 33:55.810
why we must do whatever it takes

33:56.030 --> 33:56.980
to make him stay.

34:03.880 --> 34:04.730
Why is it so quiet?

34:05.350 --> 34:06.180
No one is here.

34:08.510 --> 34:09.530
Don't tell me they ran off

34:09.880 --> 34:10.810
to avoid paying up.

34:19.350 --> 34:20.140
Young Master Han,

34:20.440 --> 34:21.490
we were just looking for you.

34:21.590 --> 34:22.420
Weren't you all out?

34:22.550 --> 34:24.010
We've been waiting here for you.

34:24.070 --> 34:24.570
Come.

34:24.960 --> 34:25.460
What for?

34:25.480 --> 34:26.180
Measurements for new clothes!

34:26.680 --> 34:27.980
- Haven't had time to wash your old ones. - What?

34:28.070 --> 34:29.010
You've killed two villains.

34:29.030 --> 34:29.490
What?

34:29.640 --> 34:30.900
We'll wash them for you.

34:30.920 --> 34:31.620
No, no need!

34:31.720 --> 34:32.850
Ladies, you don't have to.

34:32.920 --> 34:33.900
From now on,

34:33.920 --> 34:35.380
we'll take care of all your laundry.

34:35.400 --> 34:36.050
No need!

34:36.070 --> 34:37.220
You've killed two,

34:37.680 --> 34:39.050
your clothes must be filthy!

34:39.110 --> 34:40.220
I'm great at sewing.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.250
From now on,

34:41.400 --> 34:42.220
I'll make all your clothes.

34:42.440 --> 34:42.810
Never mind.

34:42.830 --> 34:44.220
Just help us out this once.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.660
Don't tell me you want me to get revenge again?

34:46.880 --> 34:47.570
That's right.

34:48.030 --> 34:48.730
Guihua Alley.

34:49.070 --> 34:49.660
Old Master Wu.

34:51.090 --> 34:51.860
I'm not going.

34:52.970 --> 34:53.660
Han Li!

35:40.200 --> 35:40.830
No.

35:41.490 --> 35:42.780
I can't delay any longer.

35:48.570 --> 35:48.860
Here.

35:48.970 --> 35:49.950
Have a bowl of herbal tea.

35:50.090 --> 35:50.780
It'll cool you down.

35:58.130 --> 35:58.950
Sir!

35:58.970 --> 36:00.380
You're finally back!

36:00.450 --> 36:01.950
Jiayuan City has been in chaos lately.

36:02.050 --> 36:03.260
Ouyang Feitian, Black Bear,

36:03.280 --> 36:05.180
and even the Mo Family's future son-in-law are dead.

36:05.200 --> 36:05.820
Where's my friend?

36:05.970 --> 36:07.380
Don't even ask about him.

36:07.450 --> 36:08.510
He is lovesick.

36:08.530 --> 36:10.030
He has been moping day and night.

36:10.050 --> 36:10.660
He does nothing

36:10.680 --> 36:11.380
but stand there.

36:11.650 --> 36:12.910
He's ruining my business.

36:17.090 --> 36:17.700
Qu Hun.

36:25.240 --> 36:25.860
Let's go.

36:34.840 --> 36:35.590
There's no time.

36:35.970 --> 36:37.150
If they try to stop us again,

36:37.760 --> 36:38.470
I won't hold back.

36:52.240 --> 36:53.590
Why did you bring someone along?

36:53.760 --> 36:54.380
He's backup.

36:57.450 --> 36:58.340
Look,

36:58.760 --> 37:00.070
aren't you misunderstanding us?

37:00.840 --> 37:01.430
What?

37:01.570 --> 37:02.660
You really think

37:02.880 --> 37:04.150
we'd try to cheat you?

37:04.650 --> 37:05.910
You know best.

37:07.130 --> 37:08.430
I did everything Physician Mo

37:08.760 --> 37:09.950
asked in the letter.

37:10.320 --> 37:11.220
As promised,

37:11.570 --> 37:13.180
hand over the Sunwarm Jade now.

37:13.680 --> 37:15.110
Don't worry.

37:15.280 --> 37:15.990
You all,

37:16.490 --> 37:16.950
hurry

37:17.240 --> 37:18.150
and bring the jade here.

37:27.530 --> 37:28.590
Young Master Han,

37:29.050 --> 37:30.590
word has been going around

37:30.720 --> 37:31.950
that the Mo family

37:32.050 --> 37:34.470
has gained a son-in-law with thunderous means.

37:34.720 --> 37:35.180
Really,

37:35.240 --> 37:37.060
we couldn't be happier.

37:37.200 --> 37:38.820
At last, we have someone to rely on.

37:39.200 --> 37:39.550
Look...

37:39.570 --> 37:40.660
Spare me the excuses.

37:42.170 --> 37:42.780
Look.

37:45.970 --> 37:47.030
Turn around and take a look.

37:48.170 --> 37:48.910
The dowries

37:49.280 --> 37:50.260
are all here.

37:56.610 --> 37:57.510
The first chest

37:58.200 --> 38:00.510
is filled with priceless gold and jewels.

38:01.360 --> 38:01.950
In the future,

38:02.240 --> 38:03.740
the earnings from all our secret ventures

38:04.170 --> 38:05.990
will be yours to manage entirely.

38:07.170 --> 38:07.820
The second chest

38:08.010 --> 38:10.220
holds our Mo family's ancestral medical compendium

38:10.450 --> 38:11.860
and the keys to the clinic storeroom.

38:13.530 --> 38:14.340
The third chest

38:14.970 --> 38:17.380
contains all the weapon manuals from the Jingjiao Sect,

38:17.760 --> 38:20.380
along with the Sect Master Token to rally the masses.

38:25.130 --> 38:26.150
You're trying to use these

38:26.490 --> 38:27.660
to keep me here?

38:28.930 --> 38:29.470
And also

38:29.720 --> 38:31.110
our three daughters.

38:33.240 --> 38:34.300
And also

38:34.570 --> 38:37.380
the four of us.

38:37.530 --> 38:38.700
We all want to leave too.

38:38.880 --> 38:39.910
Don't forget me.

38:40.490 --> 38:41.980
We all want to go with you,

38:42.090 --> 38:43.510
together.

38:44.570 --> 38:45.510
Take us with you.

38:45.840 --> 38:46.740
Let's run away together.

38:47.010 --> 38:48.340
Who said I'm taking you along?

38:49.090 --> 38:50.150
Let me be clear.

38:50.610 --> 38:51.300
None of those three

38:51.840 --> 38:52.700
will ever be my wife.

38:53.130 --> 38:53.950
The four of you

38:54.170 --> 38:55.340
are not coming with me!

38:56.200 --> 38:57.030
Young Master,

38:57.320 --> 38:58.380
take me with you.

38:58.680 --> 38:59.380
Go back.

39:00.240 --> 39:01.590
All I want is the Sunwarm Jade!

39:01.800 --> 39:02.260
Why...

39:02.610 --> 39:04.220
Why don't you want me?

39:04.450 --> 39:06.180
Are the Three Beauties not good enough for you?

39:06.450 --> 39:08.150
Where did you get the confidence?

39:08.360 --> 39:09.470
I'm one of the four Han heirs!

39:09.720 --> 39:10.780
If I say no, it's no.

39:11.010 --> 39:12.070
Don't even try to persuade me!

39:17.090 --> 39:20.220
What are we supposed to do without a man in the house?

39:20.880 --> 39:21.990
I know what the ladies

39:22.010 --> 39:23.950
are really up to with all this crying.

39:24.240 --> 39:25.340
- Stop crying. - With Father gone,

39:25.530 --> 39:27.910
those eying the Mo family fortune will surely strike.

39:28.280 --> 39:29.430
- Stop crying. - The ladies just want

39:29.450 --> 39:30.780
to keep this cultivator here...

39:30.800 --> 39:31.910
- Stop crying! - to protect us.

39:32.320 --> 39:34.220
As for marrying us off and giving him the Sunwarm Jade,

39:34.320 --> 39:35.910
they never meant to follow through.

39:36.320 --> 39:38.430
I just hope Li doesn't fall for it.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.700
Keep this up

39:47.090 --> 39:48.630
and I'll burn this place to the ground.

39:58.720 --> 40:00.150
So there's really no room to talk?

40:00.530 --> 40:01.300
None at all.

40:07.800 --> 40:08.860
The Sunwarm Jade.

40:09.840 --> 40:10.860
Hand it over now.

40:12.450 --> 40:13.470
No more talking.

40:13.880 --> 40:14.740
Attack!

40:23.880 --> 40:25.030
You've been poisoned by Silver Demon Palm.

40:25.170 --> 40:26.630
You don't have long left.

40:26.840 --> 40:28.300
Once that poison sets in,

40:28.490 --> 40:29.630
not only can you not cultivate,

40:29.800 --> 40:30.950
you won't live much longer.

40:31.050 --> 40:31.820
If I die,

40:31.930 --> 40:32.820
you're coming with me!

40:33.130 --> 40:33.910
Stay here,

40:33.930 --> 40:34.990
and no one has to die.

40:35.050 --> 40:36.110
The Sunwarm Jade, now!

40:36.450 --> 40:37.380
Are you handing it over or not?

40:37.530 --> 40:38.660
No!

40:38.720 --> 40:39.820
We're dead either way.

40:40.090 --> 40:41.340
If you've got the guts, kill me.

40:41.530 --> 40:42.430
Kill us all.

40:42.450 --> 40:43.660
- Kill us! - Go ahead!

40:43.930 --> 40:44.910
Kill every one of us!

40:44.930 --> 40:45.740
Kill us!

40:46.090 --> 40:46.780
Do it!

40:49.280 --> 40:49.910
Kill us!

40:50.090 --> 40:50.510
Kill us!

40:50.570 --> 40:51.180
Go on!

40:51.200 --> 40:51.700
Kill us!

40:51.760 --> 40:52.510
Kill!

40:52.530 --> 40:53.180
The poison's taking effect.

40:54.280 --> 40:55.260
You can talk?

40:55.530 --> 40:56.470
Kill us!

40:57.610 --> 40:58.150
Hurry!

40:58.760 --> 40:59.340
Quick!

40:59.760 --> 41:00.220
Hurry!

41:00.400 --> 41:01.030
Sleeping drug?

41:01.490 --> 41:02.260
Hurry!

41:27.590 --> 41:32.910
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

41:34.150 --> 41:39.550
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

41:39.670 --> 41:42.870
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

41:43.110 --> 41:45.350
♪Old scenes rise again♪

41:45.750 --> 41:48.590
♪Too hard to forget♪

41:49.110 --> 41:53.070
♪Easier just to miss♪

41:53.910 --> 41:59.390
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

42:00.550 --> 42:05.830
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

42:06.430 --> 42:09.470
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

42:09.750 --> 42:11.870
♪Swept away by time♪

42:12.510 --> 42:15.150
♪Eyes once looked far♪

42:15.630 --> 42:19.590
♪Now lost in the shift♪

42:20.070 --> 42:22.910
♪Autumn winds stir♪

42:23.190 --> 42:25.110
♪Smoke curls once more♪

42:25.550 --> 42:27.990
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

42:28.310 --> 42:31.830
♪Returning to my eyes♪

42:32.390 --> 42:35.350
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

42:35.670 --> 42:38.590
♪Time lost its name♪

42:38.990 --> 42:41.830
♪Was it yesterday♪

42:42.230 --> 42:45.790
♪Or tomorrow?♪

42:46.150 --> 42:48.990
♪The world has changed♪

42:49.390 --> 42:51.230
♪Beyond recall♪

42:51.790 --> 42:53.510
♪Time will fade♪

42:53.910 --> 42:58.710
♪All the words ever spoken♪

42:59.390 --> 43:02.270
♪Only this longing remains♪

43:02.750 --> 43:08.030
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

43:09.150 --> 43:15.790
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

43:16.270 --> 43:25.990
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
